# Apex 26 — Cursor entry

- **Rules:** read root `AGENTS.md` (canonical). Root `CLAUDE.md` is a stub that
  imports it; do not edit rules into `CLAUDE.md`.
  Coordination: `docs/WORKERS.md` and AGENTS.md §Coordination. Path-scoped rules: edit `.claude/rules/*.md`,
  then `npm run gen` (never hand-edit the generated `.mdc` twins).
- **Skills / subagents:** `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md` and `.claude/agents/*.md`
  (shared with Claude Code). Codex via `.agents/skills/<name>`
  (`bash tools/env/mirror-skills.sh`) — keep lockstep, never fork. Do not add
  `.cursor/skills/` or `.cursor/agents/` unless Cursor-only.
- **Route:** deploy/`version.json` → `deploy-research` (host fetch / WebFetch);
  pre-push → `verify-agent` (`--base <ref>` for "was it already red?");
  live canvas → `mcp-probe`; host browser → `playwright-official`;
  bloat/extract/dead code → `slim-bloat` / `bloat-auditor`. Do not attach
  `mcp-probe` for a version.json check.
- **MCP:** six servers in `.mcp.json` / `.cursor/mcp.json` (`apex-tools`,
  `playwright-official`, `chrome-devtools`, `js-debugger`, `apex-lsp`, `browserstack`); plugin
  MCPs (e.g. **browser-use**) → `mcpPluginServerAllowlist`. Catalog does **not** auto-load —
  `tools/mcp/apex-tools-mcp.sh call`,
  `tools/mcp/chrome-devtools-mcp.sh`, `probe-mcp.py chrome-start`; `tinyfish-mcp.sh`
  CLI-only. Map: `docs/AGENT-SURFACE.md`.
- **Cursor Cloud:** `composer-2.5` for routine jobs; Grok 7 for hard jobs only
  (confirm its exact Cursor slug at launch — do not invent one); never `default`
  or Auto. Dispatcher: `hosts.cursor.model` in `tools/ci/dispatch.json`. Namespaces:
  `cursor*` plus six repo
  servers after Bootstrap §3; bare `cursor*` only → CLI fallbacks, re-Save when
  `environment-info` shows nameless `bash` rows. For subscriptions and drafter/steward endings, follow
  `docs/WORKERS.md` §Per vendor; discover the actual host tools before calling them.
- **Token hygiene:** one skill per task; prefer `__apex` / `verify-track` /
  `test:tooling-fast` before screenshots or browser groups. Bootstrap / Cloud
  MCP: `docs/AGENT-SURFACE.md` §Bootstrap.
